## Challenge creation & camera (1-tap)

- **`+ BATTLE` FAB** and Battles **LAUNCH ARENA CHALLENGE** → **single tap** into `UniversalCamera` challenge / opener mode.
- Keep **`RECORDING_TEARDOWN_MS = 200`** before preview/unmount.

